*> Implementation test of vanilla click semantics on the inventory screen (40-menus-1 section 3.4 and 5.5; tasks T4600 to T4603): a right click takes the larger
*> half or puts one item down, and is predicted; a left drag over several slots splits the cursor evenly, a right drag puts one item on each, a one-slot drag is a
*> PICKUP; the packets are the three kinds of QUICK_CRAFT. Starting items: slots 0 to 7 hold 64 of items 2 to 9, state id 1. Slot -999 is the Short fc19.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-INVENTORY-POINTER.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 COPY CLCONST.
 COPY CCSHIM.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 01 WS-SERVER              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CONN                BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-THRESHOLD           BINARY-LONG VALUE -1.
 01 WS-PATH                PIC X(256).
 01 WS-TEXT                PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-KEY                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SLOT                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ACTION              BINARY-LONG VALUE 15.
 01 WS-FOUND               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MODS                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BUTTON              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PX                  FLOAT-SHORT.
 01 WS-PY                  FLOAT-SHORT.
 01 WS-N                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-E1                  PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E2                  PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-JIT               BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-DOWN              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-EVENTS.
    05 WS-EVENT OCCURS 2 TIMES.
       10 WS-KIND          BINARY-LONG.
       10 WS-A             BINARY-LONG.
       10 WS-B             BINARY-LONG.
       10 WS-C             BINARY-LONG.
       10 WS-X             FLOAT-SHORT.
       10 WS-Y             FLOAT-SHORT.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "TEST-PLAY" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-SERVER
     CALL "TEST-FEED-STARTING-ITEMS" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-CONN
     CALL "TEST-STEP" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE CC-KEY-E TO WS-KEY
     CALL "TEST-KEY" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-KEY
     MOVE 0 TO IN-CAPTURED
     CALL "TEST-SERVER-READ-HEX" USING WS-SERVER WS-TEXT WS-THRESHOLD

     MOVE "test inventory pointer right click takes the larger half and predicts it" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO WS-SLOT
     MOVE CC-BUTTON-RIGHT TO WS-BUTTON
     PERFORM CLICK-SLOT
     MOVE "12000100240100010024" & "0102200000" & "0102200000 slot 32x2 cursor 32x2" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "test inventory pointer right click with a cursor puts one item on an empty slot" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 20 TO WS-SLOT
     PERFORM CLICK-SLOT
     MOVE "12000100" & "140100010" & "0140102010000" & "01021f0000 slot 1x2 cursor 31x2" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "test inventory pointer a left drag over three slots splits the cursor evenly" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 12 TO WS-SLOT
     MOVE CC-BUTTON-LEFT TO WS-BUTTON
     PERFORM DRAG-DOWN
     PERFORM DRAG-NUDGE
     PERFORM DRAG-TO
     MOVE 13 TO WS-SLOT
     PERFORM DRAG-TO
     MOVE 14 TO WS-SLOT
     PERFORM DRAG-TO
     PERFORM DRAG-UP
     MOVE "120001fc1900050001021f0000 120001000c01050001021f0000 120001000d01050001021f0000 "
         & "120001000e01050001021f0000 120001fc190205000102010000 slot 10x2 cursor 1x2" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "test inventory pointer a right drag over three slots puts one item on each" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 30 TO WS-SLOT
     MOVE CC-BUTTON-LEFT TO WS-BUTTON
     PERFORM CLICK-SLOT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-SLOT
     MOVE CC-BUTTON-RIGHT TO WS-BUTTON
     PERFORM CLICK-SLOT
     MOVE 15 TO WS-SLOT
     PERFORM DRAG-DOWN
     PERFORM DRAG-NUDGE
     PERFORM DRAG-TO
     MOVE 16 TO WS-SLOT
     PERFORM DRAG-TO
     MOVE 17 TO WS-SLOT
     PERFORM DRAG-TO
     PERFORM DRAG-UP
     MOVE "120001fc190405000103200000 120001000f0505000103200000 12000100100505000103200000 "
         & "12000100110505000103200000 120001fc1906050001031d0000 slot 1x3 cursor 29x3" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "test inventory pointer a right click on a one-item stack takes it whole (the slot is emptied in the prediction)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 31 TO WS-SLOT
     MOVE CC-BUTTON-LEFT TO WS-BUTTON
     PERFORM CLICK-SLOT
     MOVE 9 TO WS-SLOT
     MOVE CC-BUTTON-RIGHT TO WS-BUTTON
     PERFORM CLICK-SLOT
     MOVE "1200010009010001000900010b010000 slot 0x0 cursor 1x11" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "test inventory pointer a left drag that shares out the whole cursor leaves it empty" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 32 TO WS-SLOT
     MOVE CC-BUTTON-LEFT TO WS-BUTTON
     PERFORM CLICK-SLOT
     MOVE 13 TO WS-SLOT
     PERFORM CLICK-SLOT
     MOVE 18 TO WS-SLOT
     PERFORM DRAG-DOWN
     PERFORM DRAG-NUDGE
     PERFORM DRAG-TO
     MOVE 19 TO WS-SLOT
     PERFORM DRAG-TO
     PERFORM DRAG-UP
     MOVE "120001fc1900050001020a0000 120001001201050001020a0000 120001001301050001020a0000 120001fc1902050000 slot 5x2 cursor 0x0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "test inventory pointer in creative the middle button drags full stacks (type 2: buttons 8, 9, 10) and a one-slot middle drag sends the same three packets" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO PL-MODE
     MOVE 18 TO WS-SLOT
     PERFORM CLICK-SLOT
     MOVE 2 TO WS-BUTTON
     MOVE 21 TO WS-SLOT
     PERFORM DRAG-DOWN
     PERFORM DRAG-NUDGE
     PERFORM DRAG-TO
     MOVE 22 TO WS-SLOT
     PERFORM DRAG-TO
     PERFORM DRAG-UP
     MOVE "120001fc190805000102050000 12000100150905000102050000 12000100160905000102050000 120001fc190a050000 slot 64x2 cursor 0x0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK
     MOVE 19 TO WS-SLOT
     MOVE CC-BUTTON-LEFT TO WS-BUTTON
     PERFORM CLICK-SLOT
     MOVE 2 TO WS-BUTTON
     MOVE 23 TO WS-SLOT
     PERFORM DRAG-DOWN
     PERFORM DRAG-NUDGE
     PERFORM DRAG-UP
     MOVE "120001fc190805000102050000 12000100170905000102050000 120001fc190a05000102050000 slot 0x0 cursor 5x2" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "test inventory pointer in creative a left click outside the window with a cursor throws it with Set Creative Mode Slot -1" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE CC-BUTTON-LEFT TO WS-BUTTON
     MOVE 2 TO WS-PX WS-PY
     PERFORM RAW-CLICK
     MOVE "39ffff05020000 slot 0x0 cursor 0x0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK
     MOVE 0 TO PL-MODE

     MOVE "test inventory pointer a click on the recipe book's panel beside the screen is inside the screen: no drop" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 20 TO WS-SLOT
     MOVE CC-BUTTON-LEFT TO WS-BUTTON
     PERFORM CLICK-SLOT
     MOVE 1 TO RK-OPEN(1)
     MOVE 1000 TO IN-WIN-W
     MOVE 200 TO WS-PX
     MOVE 200 TO WS-PY
     PERFORM RAW-CLICK
     MOVE 0 TO RK-OPEN(1)
     MOVE 640 TO IN-WIN-W
     MOVE "slot 0x0 cursor 1x2" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK
     STOP RUN.

*> Window position of the centre of slot widget WS-SLOT (WS-PX, WS-PY).
 SLOT-POS.
     MOVE 2 TO WS-PX WS-PY
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > SM-WIDGET-COUNT
         IF SM-W-KIND(WS-I) = WK-SLOT AND SM-W-ARG(WS-I) = WS-SLOT
             COMPUTE WS-PX = (SM-W-X(WS-I) + SM-W-W(WS-I) / 2) * CL-GUI-SCALE
             COMPUTE WS-PY = (SM-W-Y(WS-I) + SM-W-H(WS-I) / 2) * CL-GUI-SCALE
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM.

*> One frame: the cursor over slot WS-SLOT, button WS-BUTTON down (WS-N 2) or up (3) or only moved (1).
 FRAME.
     PERFORM SLOT-POS
     INITIALIZE WS-EVENTS
     MOVE CC-EV-CURSOR TO WS-KIND(1)
     COMPUTE WS-X(1) = WS-PX + WS-JIT
     MOVE WS-PY TO WS-Y(1)
     MOVE WS-PX TO WS-X(2)
     MOVE WS-PY TO WS-Y(2)
     MOVE WS-BUTTON TO WS-A(2)
     MOVE WS-DOWN TO WS-KIND(2)
     CALL "TEST-EVENTS" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-EVENTS WS-N.

 RAW-CLICK.
     INITIALIZE WS-EVENTS
     MOVE CC-EV-BUTTON-DOWN TO WS-KIND(1)
     MOVE CC-EV-BUTTON-UP TO WS-KIND(2)
     MOVE WS-BUTTON TO WS-A(1) WS-A(2)
     MOVE WS-PX TO WS-X(1) WS-X(2)
     MOVE WS-PY TO WS-Y(1) WS-Y(2)
     MOVE 2 TO WS-N
     CALL "TEST-EVENTS" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-EVENTS WS-N
     PERFORM OBSERVE.

 CLICK-SLOT.
     MOVE CC-EV-BUTTON-DOWN TO WS-DOWN
     MOVE 2 TO WS-N
     PERFORM FRAME
     MOVE CC-EV-BUTTON-UP TO WS-DOWN
     PERFORM FRAME
     PERFORM OBSERVE.

 DRAG-DOWN.
     MOVE CC-EV-BUTTON-DOWN TO WS-DOWN
     MOVE 2 TO WS-N
     PERFORM FRAME.

 DRAG-NUDGE.
     MOVE 8 TO WS-JIT
     PERFORM DRAG-TO
     MOVE 0 TO WS-JIT.

 DRAG-TO.
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM FRAME.

 DRAG-UP.
     MOVE CC-EV-BUTTON-UP TO WS-DOWN
     MOVE 2 TO WS-N
     PERFORM FRAME
     PERFORM OBSERVE.

 OBSERVE.
     CALL "TEST-SERVER-READ-HEX" USING WS-SERVER WS-TEXT WS-THRESHOLD
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE PL-SLOT-COUNT(WS-SLOT + 1) TO WS-E1
     MOVE PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-SLOT + 1) TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TEXT) " slot " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "x" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2)
         DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE PL-CARRIED-COUNT TO WS-E1
     MOVE PL-CARRIED-ITEM TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) " cursor " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "x" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2)
         DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) TO WS-TEXT.

 CHECK.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TEXT) TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.
 END PROGRAM TEST-INVENTORY-POINTER.
 COPY CLTEST.
